Changes from upstream (the "fork"):
  * The crates were renamed `mu-*` -> `phi-wire-*` so they can be published to
    crates.io under the hibuka-labs namespace.
  * `mu-protocol`'s embedded Playwright contract
    (`api/contract/playwright-v1.json`) was moved into the crate directory
    (`crates/protocol/contract/`) and the `include_str!` path rewritten, so
    the crate packages on its own.
  * Packaging metadata only. No protocol or transport logic was changed.

